30525331129155_7747550886624196249_n.png?_nc_cat=111&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=B1pmwBqs1FoQ7kNvwHkeACP&_nc_oc=AdkeKrLy-UbGFB8vxuYO-fSiGeTrLbZBGNMq-q2sg3Edjv_FzIuuJFJgYAc2YcIa9c0&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-1.oculuscdn.com&oh=00_Aftx1doHszzSce1WqNVZCan0eF2ZrSN6Pik8z0lSAsplTQ&oe=69A41FCD"}, "display_name": "Pets & Stuff", "keywords": ["cat", "animal", "kids", "cute", "shave"], "long_description": "**Pets & Stuff** \u2013 a cute, fun and relaxing game where you become a skillful groomer and veterinarian. Help little friends in trouble, make them happy, pampered, clean, well-fed, and don't forget to add a pinch of chic. Let your imagination run wild!\n\nEnjoy a fully responsive and polished gameplay, make the best trims, feel the fur at your fingertips and capture the best photoshoots of your creations. \n\n**Meet a wide range of pets**\n{1337478634686148}\n\nHelp a variety of furry friends in need: cats, dogs, raccoons, foxes, deer and so many more!\n\n**Explore tools and accessories**\n{1269757408529080}\n\nFrom fly swatters to vacuum cleaners, you'll have a range of tools to take care of each pet. Use color sprays, collars and shades for a stylish finish!\n\n**Upgrade your clinic and discover new locations**\n{1583697675978106}\n\nDiscover all four unique locations\u2014Clinic, Forest, Farm, and Fantasy Land\u2014and earn stars to upgrade your workspace to a cozy clinic!\n\nCuteness overload and furrrr everywhere guaranteed!", "short_description": "Pets & Stuff \u2013 a cute, fun and relaxing game where you become a skillful groomer and veterinarian using a variety of tools, meds and stylish accessories. Let your imagination run wild! \n\nHelp little friends in trouble, make them happy, pampered, clean, well-fed, and while on it - feel free to add a pinch of chic. Enjoy a fully responsive and polished gameplay with different locations to explore, many adorable pets and lots of creativity boosting gadgets to play with."}]}, "developer_name": "HyperVR Games", "d